      "label": "ask_user",
      "description": "Ask 1–20 questions using native interactive dialogs. Supports single, multi, preview, freeform and secret questions, custom answers and notes. Blocks for the user's answers. Dismissal returns cancelled without partial answers; an elapsed dialog deadline returns timedOut. Print/JSON without UI returns interactionUnavailable. Secret values are stored encrypted and only placeholders appear in answers or session records.",
