      "name": "bash",
      "label": "bash",
      "description": "Run a local shell command in the captured Workbench location. Defaults: foreground, 120-second hard deadline, stdin closed. background returns a job ID immediately; yield_seconds promotes a still-running command after that delay. timeout_seconds=0 disables the deadline. interactive keeps stdin open for jobs write/eof. Cancellation terminates the owned process group. Output is bounded and reports its byte cursor and any eviction gap.",
      "promptSnippet": "Run shell commands with owned background jobs and bounded output."
